{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    
    Make sure:
    - Shopify Liquid syntax is valid.
    - Section sche
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; background:{{ block.settings.background_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px; overflow:hidden; color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { position:relative; padding:48px 5%; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner:after { content:""; position:absolute; width:420px; height:420px; right:-150px; top:-170px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,214,10,.25) 0 18%, transparent 19% 31%, rgba(255,214,10,.12) 32% 34%, transparent 35%); pointer-events:none; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:540px; margin:0 0 26px; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,48px); line-height:1.05; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__carousel-wrap { position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display:flex; gap:18px; overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scrollbar-width:none; padding:4px 3px 14px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3); min-width:0; scroll-snap-align:start; background:{{ block.settings.card_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(31,81,48,.08); transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover { transform:translateY(-5px); box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(31,81,48,.16); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual { position:relative; aspect-ratio:1/1; overflow:hidden; background:#edf1e9; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; transition:transform .35s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual img { transform:scale(1.035); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#87958b; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width:70%; height:70%; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { position:absolute; top:12px; left:12px; padding:5px 9px; border-radius:20px; background:{{ block.settings.badge_color }}; color:#14231a; font:700 11px/1 sans-serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount { position:absolute; top:12px; right:12px; padding:5px 9px; border-radius:20px; background:{{ block.settings.discount_color }}; color:#14231a; font:700 11px/1 sans-serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content { position:relative; padding:17px; min-height:190px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating { display:inline-block; margin-bottom:9px; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:5px; background:#fff4b8; color:#4e4300; font:600 11px sans-serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin:0 0 6px; font:600 20px/1.15 Georgia,serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { margin:0 0 13px; color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font:14px/1.4 sans-serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font:700 18px sans-serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; text-decoration:line-through; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add { position:absolute; right:15px; bottom:15px; width:42px; height:42px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:{{ block.settings.button_color }}; color:#fff; cursor:pointer; display:grid; place-items:center; transition:transform .2s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:hover { transform:scale(1.08); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:focus-visible, .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible { outline:3px solid {{ block.settings.badge_color }}; outline-offset:3px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add svg { width:20px; height:20px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { position:absolute; z-index:2; top:45%; width:42px; height:42px; border:0; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer; background:{{ block.settings.button_color }}; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.16); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev { left:-16px; opacity:.65; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next { right:-16px; }
  @media (max-width: 990px) { .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2); } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { padding:32px 18px; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner:after { display:none; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:86%; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev { left:-8px; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next { right:-8px; } }
{% endstyle %}

<plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__carousel-wrap">
      <button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous plants">&#8592;</button>
      <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          {% liquid
            assign image_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_image'
            assign title_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign description_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign price_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_price'
            assign original_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_original'
            assign discount_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_discount'
            assign rating_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_rating'
            assign reviews_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_reviews'
            assign link_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_link'
            assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_product'
            assign bestseller_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_bestseller'
            assign bestseller_text_key = 'product_' | append: i | append: '_bestseller_text'
            assign image = block.settings[image_key]
            assign title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign product = block.settings[product_key]
          %}
          {% if title != blank or image != blank or product != blank %}
            <article class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
              <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual">
                {% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default: title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="900">{% else %}<div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
                {% if block.settings[bestseller_key] %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings[bestseller_text_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if block.settings[discount_key] != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount">{{ block.settings[discount_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content">
                <span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ block.settings[rating_key] }} | {{ block.settings[reviews_key] }}</span>
                <h3 class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ title | escape }}</h3>
                <p class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings[description_key] | escape }}</p>
                <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ block.settings[price_key] | escape }}{% if block.settings[original_key] != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ block.settings[original_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
                {% if product != blank %}<button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" type="button" data-variant="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ title | escape }} to cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 8h12l1 12H5L6 8Z"/><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg></button>{% elsif block.settings[link_key] != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" href="{{ block.settings[link_key] }}" aria-label="View {{ title | escape }}">&#8594;</a>{% endif %}
              </div>
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" type="button" aria-label="Next plants">&#8594;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  class PlantCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]'); this.prev=this.querySelector('.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev'); this.next=this.querySelector('.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next');
      this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.track.scrollBy({left:-this.track.clientWidth*.8,behavior:'smooth'})); this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.track.scrollBy({left:this.track.clientWidth*.8,behavior:'smooth'}));
      this.querySelectorAll('[data-variant]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:Number(button.dataset.variant),quantity:1}]})}).then(()=>button.setAttribute('aria-label','Added to cart')).catch(()=>{})));
    }
  }
  customElements.define('plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}',PlantCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

